{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zkBWOOVUgL1795654310.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>希音第三季收入按年下跌近百分之6。</p><p></p><p>至102.7億美元，主要由於歐洲市場貿易政策調整，公司上調價格以覆蓋新增成本，需求隨之回落所致。期內純利46.4億美元，按年上升6.5倍。經調整淨利潤增加近兩成七，至7.9億美元。   </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T01:58:48.086738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T00:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:18.598217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T01:52:08.195222+00:00","content_hash":"9223003790b4967d9af36bba8f8f027915f379a9be0011131231971ba9fbbc57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T01:58:48.086738+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}